An app in Latvian (in the future English as well) probably a web app, that can be hosted by each user so there is no public server. Peer to peer can be an option, probably a good one.
App tracks kids points that are gathered doing overall good deeds:
* cleaning the house
* dishes / clothes
* looking after siblings
* being overy polite
* etc

git repo: https://github.com/rihardiii/punktu_sistema.git

[ ] starting version 0.01
[ ] version increment by .01 or more depending on how big of a change or addition
[ ] Each good deed has some weight to it and good deeds can be added in the future by the parents.
[ ] Each good deed should have some icon representing it (can be generated or added by the user or left blank)
[ ] multiple users: Mom, Dad and a Kid.
[ ] Mom and Dad are parent / admin users
[ ] kid is normal users
[ ] parents can have multiple kids
[ ] app can be used in android and windows and linux (optional)
[ ] kid can add newly done job and parents can after inspection accept it and the points can be added to the kids account
[ ] points can be exchanged to other stuff by the kid, for example: console playtime, money and so on
[ ] parents accept or deny the request.
[ ] dark / light / custom
[ ] kids friendly design
[ ] friendly to parents as well